OL,3,GNEWSAMum and daughter attempt banger
OL,4,Arace to Benidorm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother and daughter duo have said
OL,7,Fthey are attempting to drive in a
OL,8,Fbanger rally from the UK to Benidorm.
OL,10,FLoredana Romano told the BBC she and
OL,11,Fher mum are driving to Spain - in a
OL,12,Fconvertible Audi they haggled for #500
OL,13,F- to raise money for the Alzheimer's
OL,14,FSociety.
OL,16,FShe said several celebrities, including
OL,17,FPeter Andre, Chesney Hawkes and Phil
OL,18,FTufnell, have signed their vehicle,
OL,19,Fwhich will be auctioned off afterwards
OL,20,Fto boost their fundraising efforts.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
